  {
    "id": "09d153eb2e15457aed93",
    "source": "Follow the initiative order in GAME STATE. On a player's turn, a message that is only talk or a question gets an answer and their turn is NOT spent; wait for them to declare an action. When they declare it, resolve it with the matching tool (pc_attack, cast_at_enemy, aoe_damage, or request_roll).",
